      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Transparent shading is not supported on Quest avatars. None of the \"VRChat/Mobile/Particles\" shaders should work on avatars except when used on a Particle System. The docs have been updated to clarify this: https://docs.vrchat.com/docs/quest-content-limitations If those particle shaders are usable on avatars outside of particle systems then that is a bug.\nThe reason that transparency is not supported on Quest avatars is that the Quest is very resource constrained and its mobile GPU is very low power. Transparent rendering is significantly more expensive than opaque rendering so the use of transparent shading has to be limited.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
