  "details": "-- Tested on Quest 1 - Latest Build 6/19/21--\n**Additive shading broke even more.**\n\nInstead of being replaced with Multiply, \"VRChat/Mobile/Particles/Additive\" now just showing up as a user-rank color shader and a flat shape.\nAs of right now, *Multiply is the only transparent shader that works* on the Quest build of VRChat.\n\nAlso , despite the \"Alpha Blended\" shader being in the \"VRChat/Mobile\" Category, it *still* doesn't let you upload a model with it's inclusion. It claims it's not \"in VRChat/Mobile\". \n\nWhen can we get word on a fix for these, *very* essential components of Quest avatars? Additive shading's already been broken for a whole 6 months- Hence, the multiply-shaded blue polygon loading man.",
